# Booking status

- Status changes MUST go through `assertTransition()` in `src/modules/booking/domain/booking.state.ts`.
- Never set `booking.status` directly with a Prisma update outside the booking service.
- Never use boolean flags (`isPaid`, `isCancelled`) to represent booking lifecycle.
